(7462174, 1183546, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''d have cloned out the ear tags... totally legal in Standard editing... to make this more "wild"    As is, it''s still a 7 from me.</td>', 'I''d have cloned out the ear tags... totally legal in Standard editing... to make this more "wild"    As is, it''s still a 7 from me.', '2016-06-29 17:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
