(7462176, 1183245, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''d like this more if the subject were natural instead of man-made.  You did a good job with the motion blur, but the large blown out areas bother me a bit.</td>', 'I''d like this more if the subject were natural instead of man-made.  You did a good job with the motion blur, but the large blown out areas bother me a bit.', '2016-06-29 17:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7462178, 1183435, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the BW conversion here.<br/> <br/>Not sure why you''d draw attention to the round thing at the bottom... that''s a hindrance to the image, in my opinion... with your title.<br/> <br/>Also... if this were mine and I had to crop the sides this close, I''d crop the top, too... to bring the eyes directly to her fabulously captured face.   More intimate, I think.<br/> <br/>I like "the story" it tells.</td>', 'I love the BW conversion here. Not sure why you''d draw attention to the round thing at the bottom... that''s a hindrance to the image, in my opinion... with your title. Also... if this were mine and I had to crop the sides this close, I''d crop the top, too... to bring the eyes directly to her fabulously captured face.   More intimate, I think. I like "the story" it tells.', '2016-06-29 17:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
