(7463359, 1183254, 180676, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> if only you had called it Ideas of Order at Key West!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the vote and comment, and the reference back to a work I had yet to discover!  Quite fitting, and an amazing read!  I dabble a bit in the poetic side, too, and love it when I can connect the art of photography with a bit of prose, or as I call it "verbal imagery".  And hey, now I know that at least two of us liked the pic despite it''s faults!  :D</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: if only you had called it Ideas of Order at Key West!!   Thanks for the vote and comment, and the reference back to a work I had yet to discover!  Quite fitting, and an amazing read!  I dabble a bit in the poetic side, too, and love it when I can connect the art of photography with a bit of prose, or as I call it "verbal imagery".  And hey, now I know that at least two of us liked the pic despite it''s faults!  :D', '2016-07-07 12:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7463395, 1183281, 103142, '<td valign="top">So beautiful. Wonderful capture of a special moment.</td>', 'So beautiful. Wonderful capture of a special moment.', '2016-07-07 19:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
