(7463398, 1183634, 103142, '<td valign="top">How wonderful that you put a person in the shot. We see a lot of Lovely Iceland pictures, but I really do think that a person makes it so much more special.<br/></td>', 'How wonderful that you put a person in the shot. We see a lot of Lovely Iceland pictures, but I really do think that a person makes it so much more special.', '2016-07-07 19:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
